
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Financial Management Review Panel</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f6;
      padding: 40px;
      color: #2c2c2e;
    }

    /* Main Panel Container */
    .drawer-panel {
      position: relative;
      width: 680px;
      min-height: 750px;
      background-color: #fafafa;
      border: 1px solid #d1d1d6;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      box-shadow: -4px 0 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    /* Section 4.3 Box */
    .finding-box {
      position: relative;
      border: 1.5px solid #4a55a2;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }

    /* Annotation Badges (4.3 & 4.4) */
    .annotation-badge {
      position: absolute;
      background-color: #5b4b7a;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1.5px solid #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .badge-4-3 {
      top: 16px;
      left: -18px;
    }

    .badge-4-4 {
      top: -12px;
      left: -48px;
    }

    /* Close Button */
    .close-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 14px;
      right: 14px;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border: 1px solid #8e9aaf;
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      color: #6c757d;
      font-size: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .close-btn:hover {
      background-color: #e9ecef;
    }

    /* Typography */
    .title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2b2b2b;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      padding-right: 36px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #7a7a7a;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #7a7a7a;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .body-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #3a3a3c;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    /* Indented Evidence Block */
    .evidence-block {
      border-left: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
      padding-left: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }

    .evidence-block p {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #4a4a4c;
    }

    .evidence-block p + p {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .resolution-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #3a3a3c;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    /* Section 4.4 Actions Box */
    .actions-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border: 1.5px solid #4a55a2;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      margin-left: 28px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }

    .btn {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 9px 18px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #3a3a3c;
      border: 1px solid #d1d1d6;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: #f2f2f7;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #261b3d;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #261b3d;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #382859;
    }

    .check-icon {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 2;
      fill: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="drawer-panel">
    <!-- 4.3 Badge -->
    <span class="annotation-badge badge-4-3">4.3</span>

    <!-- Main Content Box -->
    <div class="finding-box">
      <button class="close-btn" aria-label="Close">&#10005;</button>

      <h2 class="title">C2 (b). Comments on Financial Management of the Company</h2>
      <div class="subtitle">Low confidence &middot; Section C &middot; Low confidence</div>

      <div class="section-label">FINDING</div>
      <p class="body-text">Scored 61% and has not been opened or edited by the analyst.</p>

      <div class="section-label">EVIDENCE</div>
      <div class="evidence-block">
        <p>Synthesised across the Internal Financial Controls report (p.72) and the CARO annexure (p.76).</p>
        <p>The two annexures differ on whether the control weaknesses are material.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section-label">SUGGESTED RESOLUTION</div>
      <p class="resolution-text">Read both annexures and reword the commentary, or accept it to clear the flag.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Action Buttons Container -->
    <div class="actions-wrapper">
      <!-- 4.4 Badge -->
      <span class="annotation-badge badge-4-4">4.4</span>

      <button class="btn btn-secondary">
        Open in memo <span>&rarr;</span>
      </button>

      <button class="btn btn-primary">
        <svg class="check-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
          <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"></polyline>
        </svg>
        Resolve
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
